  "acknowledgement": "Thanks — I’ve noted that you will provide a list of email addresses and that you want PII fully removed from the export.",
  "instructions_for_providing_user_list": {
    "preferred_method": "Upload the list via the secure portal (recommended). If you need, we can provide a temporary upload link.",
